cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic or technical work, please cite it as below."
title: "NovelCraft AI"
abstract: >-
  A single-instance, invite-only workspace for writing Chinese long-form fiction.
  Work is organised as project to outline, volume, story arc and chapter; the model
  only proposes candidates that the author confirms before anything is persisted.
  This repository is the partially open-sourced (open-core) engineering release:
  application structure, data model, API, UI, deployment and the offline test suite
  are included, while the prompt orchestration and quality strategies that determine
  output quality are not.
type: software
authors:
